  <meta property="og:description" content="The City of Houston will conduct a general election on Tuesday, November 2, 2027, from 7 a.m. to 7 p.m. at voting sites available throughout the City of Houston, at which there will be elected the following officers of the City for a four-year term of office commencing January 2, 2028." />
